h2 Viewing people

table.table
  thead
    tr
      th[scope="col"] ID
      th[scope="col"] Name
      th[scope="col"] Phone number
      th[scope="col"] Email address
      th[scope="col"] Company
  tbody
    - @people.each do |person|
      tr
        th[scope="row"]= person&.id
        td= person&.name
        td= person&.phone_number
        td= person&.email
        td= person&.company&.name

= paginate @people
